WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.000
If a product is faulty, not as described or not fit for purpose, the shop must give you your money back. You have the same rights in the sales. A «no refunds» sign is illegal.

2
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:27.800
If you have only changed your mind (size, colour), in a physical shop you have no right to a refund: it depends on the shop's policy.

3
00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:41.100
Online, by phone or by post: 14 days from delivery to cancel for any reason; then 14 days to send it back, and the shop refunds you within 14 days.

4
00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:57.100
If you report a fault in the first 6 months, the shop must repair or replace it unless it proves it was not faulty. You can claim for up to 6 years (5 in Scotland). Free help: Citizens Advice, 0808 223 1133 (England and Wales).

5
00:00:57.100 --> 00:01:04.300
Now do the lesson exercises. If you are unsure, watch this video again.
